(:doc :symbol "asl/agentLoop/coreCli.asl#" :text "asl-host run asl/agentLoop/coreCli.asl CORPUS: reads netstring cases (<len>:<bytes>; kind, field count, fields) and prints one line per case, <index> <kind> <result>, in the serialisation of tests/acceptance/r1AgentLoop/coreParity.py. scripts/agentLoop/loop.py sends its batches here on /dev/stdin (ASLF stage 2); the kinds window, strip, kv, key, seen, spanSeen, reads, steps, dataFindings, nearest, terminal, gate, note, outward, changePlan, repair and the LP2 claims kinds and LP3 retry/advisor kinds (extractClaims receiptBacks isBacked isProseClaimBacked turnBringsEvidence forgetCutEvidence isTurnObservation unwrapReadTxns mergeFindings wrongCitationNote hasNegatorNear extractProseStrings collectProseStrings batchingRates costForm escalationNear reinforceWhyFor nowForm noWriteNudge gateNow buildRetryBrief advisorSkip parseAdvice parseSpecVerdict digestLine evidenceDigest advisorGateOutput advisorOpLine advisorSummary) and the LP4 gate kinds (gateVerdicts vacuousOutsideOwns isSwallowedExceptLine isPassLine isSingleLineSwallow findSwallowedInAdded scanSwallowed placeholderHit missingGatePaths missingGateFiles gateRunScripts gatePartitionFiles gateVacuousMessage gateRevertVerdict) and LP3b loop kinds (sessionHeader endStatus finalGatesGreen preserveFiles handBackRestore loopBoundary) serve it")
