(:doc :symbol "asl/agentLoop/diff.asl#" :text "Pure ASL unified diff and similarity ratio replacing Python difflib in agentLoop: unifiedDiff byte-identical to difflib.unified_diff, ratio equal to SequenceMatcher(None, a, b).ratio() with matching autojunk semantics above 200 elements and longest-matching-block recursion under 200 elements.")
